sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User / Browser
  participant Server as SPA Server (server.py / server.js)
  participant Router as History API Router (app.js)
  participant View as View Renderer (views.js)
  participant Store as Store / Continuity Engine

  User->>Server: GET /app/tasks/TK-1001 (Direct URL or Refresh)
  Note over Server: Non-file path detected -> fallback to index.html
  Server-->>User: HTTP 200 OK index.html
  User->>Router: Execute app.js (Initial render)
  Router->>Router: normalizePath("/app/tasks/TK-1001")
  Router->>View: Match regex /^/app/tasks/(?<id>[^/]+)/?$/
  View->>Store: find('tasks', 'TK-1001')
  Store-->>View: Task Record Data
  View-->>Router: { title, crumb, actions, html }
  Router->>User: Inject into #view, update document.title, re-hydrate icons
  
  Note over User: User clicks internal link <a href="/app/dashboard" data-link>
  User->>Router: click event intercepted (preventDefault)
  Router->>Router: history.pushState({}, '', '/app/dashboard')
  Router->>View: render(true)
  View-->>User: Dynamic DOM update without full page reload
  
  Note over User: User clicks Browser Back Button
  User->>Router: window popstate event
  Router->>Router: render(true)
  Router-->>User: Re-renders previous state
